-- Property checks of circular תשפ"ו/2 (MMS-452): its rules over finite
-- spaces, section by section. They sit here, beside the module, because
-- the circulars' root imports it: names of the checks' own stay out of the
-- root's reach.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2025-26_tashpo_02`

§ `Property checks`

`both booleans of תשפ"ו/2` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`positions checked of תשפ"ו/2` MEANS LIST 0, 0.25, 1 DIVIDED BY 3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8, 0.9, 1
`hundredths to 1 of תשפ"ו/2` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 100) (range 0 100)
`every role of תשפ"ו/2` MEANS LIST `kindergarten manager`, `associate kindergarten teacher`, `cluster manager`
`every age status of תשפ"ו/2` MEANS LIST `under 50`, `50 to 55`, `55 and over, new`, `55 and over, existing`

GIVEN old IS A BOOLEAN, a IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `kindergarten teacher`
DECIDE `a checked תשפ"ו/2 teacher` old a c s f IS
    `kindergarten teacher` WITH
        `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS old
        `academic`                IS a
        `certified to teach`      IS c
        `seniority in years`      IS s
        `position fraction`       IS f

-- 3 over every flag, position and seniority 20 to 30: an existing teacher
-- joins exactly as a certified academic from a third or a non-academic
-- from 28 years; one who may not be promoted is exactly uncertified below
-- 25.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN old YIELD
                all (GIVEN a YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                LET t MEANS `a checked תשפ"ו/2 teacher` old a c s f
                                                IN      `joins Ofek Hadash` t EQUALS (old AND (IF a THEN c AND f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE s AT LEAST 28))
                                                    AND `an uncertified teacher may not be promoted` t EQUALS ((NOT c) AND s LESS THAN 25))
                                            (range 20 30))
                                    `positions checked of תשפ"ו/2`)
                            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`

-- 3.5-3.6 over positions, months, years and reasons: the internship year
-- counts exactly from a third and six months; an intern stays within two
-- years or with the degree and certificate; only a recognised reason is
-- heard; a substitute is on reform terms exactly in weekly hours replacing
-- one in the reform.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                all (GIVEN m YIELD `the internship year is recognised` f m EQUALS (f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 AND m AT LEAST 6)) (range 0 10))
            `positions checked of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD `the intern may stay on reform terms` y d EQUALS (y AT MOST 2 OR d)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            (range 0 4)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `a request not to join may be considered` r EQUALS NOT r EQUALS `another reason`)
            (LIST `health with current medical proof`, `a personal change for the worse`, `another reason`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                all (GIVEN w YIELD `the substitute is on reform terms` r w EQUALS (r AND w)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`

-- 4 over every role and age status: the base is the role's full base less
-- 0, 2 or 4 hours, the same hours 8's table takes off, never higher for an
-- existing teacher of 55 than a new one; a cluster row exactly from 4 to 11
-- kindergartens (finding), every row 34 hours.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                all (GIVEN a YIELD
                        `the position base` r `under 50` MINUS `the position base` r a EQUALS `age hours off a full base` a)
                    `every age status of תשפ"ו/2`
                AND `the position base` r `55 and over, existing` AT MOST `the position base` r `55 and over, new`)
            `every role of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    (count (`the cluster rows for` n) EQUALS 1) EQUALS (n AT LEAST 4 AND n AT MOST 11)
                AND all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `cluster total` EQUALS 34) (`the cluster rows for` n))
            (range 1 14)

-- 5-6 over flags, positions and hours: a part position is allowed for the
-- health professions, from a third, or for a new teacher with approval; a
-- therapist's part week adds up to 36 times the position; a period counts
-- exactly from a third; within the ceiling exactly to 42 hours.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                all (GIVEN h YIELD
                        all (GIVEN ap YIELD
                                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                        `the part-time position is allowed` ex h ap f EQUALS (h OR f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 OR ((NOT ex) AND ap)))
                                    `positions checked of תשפ"ו/2`)
                            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                    `hours of the week` (`the part-time therapist's week` f) EQUALS 36 TIMES f
                AND `the period counts towards the minimum period for promotion` f EQUALS (f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3))
            `positions checked of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN h YIELD `within the 42-hour ceiling` h EQUALS (h AT MOST 42)) (range 30 50)

-- 7 over positions, children's ages and months: a mother's position
-- exactly from 79% with a child up to 14, 10% more only when never absent;
-- the nursing hours exactly from 90% within four months.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                    all (GIVEN c YIELD `entitled to a mother's position` f c EQUALS (f AT LEAST 0.79 AND c AT MOST 14)) (range 0 18)
                AND all (GIVEN n YIELD `a mother's position` f n EQUALS (IF n THEN f PLUS 0.1 ELSE f)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`
                AND all (GIVEN w YIELD `nursing hours off a week` f w EQUALS (IF w AND f AT LEAST 0.9 THEN 5 ELSE 0)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            `hundredths to 1 of תשפ"ו/2`

-- 8-9 over ages, positions and hours: the age status by 50 and 55, existing
-- or new; the hours off for a part base their share up to one position;
-- never more than 40 activity hours paid in a year.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                            `age hours off a full base` (`the age status for the year` n ex) AT MOST `age hours off a full base` (`the age status for the year` (n PLUS 1) ex)
                        AND `age hours off a full base` (`the age status for the year` n FALSE) AT MOST `age hours off a full base` (`the age status for the year` n TRUE)
                        AND all (GIVEN f YIELD `age hours off a part-time base` (`the age status for the year` n ex) f EQUALS `age hours off a full base` (`the age status for the year` n ex) TIMES min f 1)
                                (LIST 0.5, 1, 1.2))
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`)
            (range 40 70)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN h YIELD
                all (GIVEN al YIELD
                            `pay for kindergarten activity` h al 100 AT MOST 100 TIMES max 0 (40 MINUS al)
                        AND `pay for kindergarten activity` h al 100 AT MOST 100 TIMES h)
                    (LIST 0, 20, 39, 40, 45))
            (range 0 12)

-- 10-11 over periods, steps, months and hours: the internship and
-- compulsory service never count; promotion needs the evaluation and both
-- requirements; a non-academic step never asks less than the academic one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                    NOT `counts as recognised seniority` `internship` ex
                AND NOT `counts as recognised seniority` `compulsory army service` ex
                AND `counts as recognised seniority` `recognised for salary before joining` ex EQUALS ex)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN st YIELD
                all (GIVEN mo YIELD
                        all (GIVEN h YIELD
                                    NOT `may be promoted` mo (50 TIMES h) FALSE st
                                AND `may be promoted` mo (50 TIMES h) TRUE st EQUALS (mo AT LEAST st's `months required` AND 50 TIMES h AT LEAST st's `development hours required`))
                            (range 0 10))
                    (map (GIVEN k YIELD 6 TIMES k) (range 0 10)))
            (append `the certified academics' steps` `the certified non-academics' steps`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN q YIELD
                        (NOT p's `from grade` EQUALS q's `from grade`)
                        OR (q's `months required` AT LEAST p's `months required` AND q's `development hours required` AT LEAST p's `development hours required`))
                    `the certified non-academics' steps`)
            `the certified academics' steps`

-- 12-15 over grades and years in halves, salaries, positions and counts: a
-- manager's rate 17%, 20% or 21%, never falling with the grade or the
-- years; the allowance never below the rate's share or the floor's
-- (finding m), nor the trailing allowance; the associate's supplement 10%
-- up to a position; the cluster rate 25% to six and 28% above; a mentor
-- never above three interns.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                all (GIVEN k YIELD
                        LET g MEANS k DIVIDED BY 2
                        IN      elem (`the management allowance rate` ex g g) (LIST 0.17, 0.2, 0.21)
                            AND `the management allowance rate` ex g g AT MOST `the management allowance rate` ex (g PLUS 0.5) (g PLUS 0.5))
                    (range 2 30))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN sal YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                        all (GIVEN tr YIELD
                                LET m MEANS `the kindergarten management allowance` 0.17 sal f tr
                                IN m AT LEAST 0.17 TIMES sal TIMES f AND m AT LEAST 1500 TIMES f AND m AT LEAST tr)
                            (LIST 0, 1000, 2000))
                    (LIST 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1))
            (map (GIVEN k YIELD 1000 TIMES k) (range 0 20))
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD `the associate's supplement` n 10000 f EQUALS (IF n THEN 1000 TIMES min f 1 ELSE 0)) (LIST 0.5, 1, 1.2))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    `the cluster management rate` n EQUALS (IF n AT MOST 6 THEN 0.25 ELSE 0.28)
                AND `the mentor's rate` n AT MOST 0.072)
            (range 1 14)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD elem (`the special-education allowance rate` (IF t THEN `not certified, in special education` ELSE `not certified`)) (`the rates for an uncertified teacher` t))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/2`

-- 16-17 over quarters, groups and shares: a conversion sets exactly whole
-- and half grades; the advance rate 10% to 16%, the advance never falling
-- with a larger share.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD `a grade the conversion may set` (k DIVIDED BY 4) EQUALS (FLOOR (k DIVIDED BY 2) TIMES 2 EQUALS k)) (range 4 36)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                    `the advance rate` g AT LEAST 0.1 AND `the advance rate` g AT MOST 0.16
                AND all (GIVEN q YIELD `the Ofek Hadash advance` g 10000 (q DIVIDED BY 4) AT MOST `the Ofek Hadash advance` g 10000 ((q PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 4)) (range 0 4))
            (LIST `academic kindergarten teacher`, `academic health-profession teacher`, `intern`, `non-academic of 28 years or more`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD all (GIVEN a YIELD `the governing answer` c a EQUALS a) (range 0 5)) (range 0 5)
